ight refers to the low wall datum, not the full church height.","The inspected front exterior shows arched openings, pale pilasters and a high narrow central belfry. Mapped facade piers are retained; window sizes are inferred within their actual wall bays.","The small uncovered ground plan uses the mapped 5 m outline height. Roof and side volumes are unioned to remove hidden overlaps; mosaic figures, brick courses and decorative text are omitted under the standard material palette."],"source":{"url":"/objects/9120137e206422296e55f93b7d1939b02f0935d04583fb64a01ba302a7fc6044/source.blend.gz","bytes":162994,"sha256":"9120137e206422296e55f93b7d1939b02f0935d04583fb64a01ba302a7fc6044"},"spatialSource":{"url":"/objects/25e89c3861d295a275c6bee0889266df67cbd9a33b91f31508aaab7db5db5ef6/spatial-source.json","bytes":17149,"sha256":"25e89c3861d295a275c6bee0889266df67cbd9a33b91f31508aaab7db5db5ef6"},"preview":{"url":"/objects/c3365d184fe730ef759eed0025717734c68ba578521fb1000ffff36ad4a6f534/preview.webp","bytes":6158,"sha256":"c3365d184fe730ef759eed0025717734c68ba578521fb1000ffff36ad4a6f534"},"previewDirection":[-2,1,1],"revision":"047e695c3048f43eaa12f130e2a0bf0b8b83091dc9911c886bed67c9efe75808","publicationRevision":"48fd3fd3eb154dfef79254e2a544e11a082a36d5e682ed1d72ef79091d039bfd","bounds":[2.285976,48.8682462,2.2868294,48.8685737],"approved":false,"materialLibrary":{"schemaVersion":1,"sha256":"808c7d2073c712316c3ada02d6762b49c869f1e88399736045303c3739e4b7a4","url":"/materials/808c7d2073c712316c3ada02d6762b49c869f1e88399736045303c3739e4b7a4.json"},"metadata":"/assets/eglise-nouvelle-saint-honore-d-eylau/48fd3fd3eb154dfef79254e2a544e11a082a36d5e682ed1d72ef79091d039bfd/asset.json","validation":"/assets/eglise-nouvelle-saint-honore-d-eylau/48fd3fd3eb154dfef79254e2a544e11a082a36d5e682ed1d72ef79091d039bfd/validation.json"}